  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/blob/main/images/banner.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"横幅\">\n<br></p>\n<h1>雷霆动态模糊</h1>\n<p>一款轻量且高性能的运动模糊着色器。即使仅使用4个样本也能呈现良好效果，非常适合PVP。<br>\n此外，请尝试调整各项设置。您可能不喜欢默认配置，建议尝试关闭抖动或调整强度。</p>\n<p>请在GitHub上报告任何问题或建议：<a href=\"https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/issues</a></p>\n<h2>着色器设置</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/blob/main/images/thunders-mb-settings.jpg?raw=true\" alt=\"着色器设置\"><br>\n强度 - 模糊的强烈程度<br>\n最大速度 - 限制模糊拖尾的长度<br>\n手部模糊 - 是否同时对玩家手部进行模糊处理<br>\n抖动模式 - 用于消除色带的抖动算法（示例见下方）<br>\n深度膨胀 - 减少边缘处的模糊溢出<br>\n<br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/blob/main/images/thunders-mb-settings-sampling.jpg?raw=true\" alt=\"采样设置\"><br>\n样本数 - 数值越高画面越平滑，但运行速度越慢<br>\n动态采样 - 根据移动速度自动调整样本数量<br>\n<br></p>\n<h2>抖动模式</h2>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td>\n      关闭<br>\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/blob/main/images/off.png?raw=true\" width=\"100%\">\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      IGN<br>\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/blob/main/images/ign.png?raw=true\" width=\"100%\">\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      蓝色噪声<br>\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/ThunderFound/thunders-motion-blur/blob/main/images/blue_noise.png?raw=true\" width=\"100%\">\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p><br></p>",
